Hello Kai,

For the HX-240, the standard EPDM seal guidance is 90°C continuous. At 92°C and an 18-hour/day duty, we recommend moving to the FKM seal rather than using the standard EPDM configuration.

Because the fluid is alkaline, please send the chemical concentration or treatment specification. Final compatibility should be confirmed against the actual chemistry.

